#. module: account_tax_python
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_tax_python.field_account_tax__amount_type
msgid ""
"\n"
"    - Group of Taxes: The tax is a set of sub taxes.\n"
"    - Fixed: The tax amount stays the same whatever the price.\n"
"    - Percentage: The tax amount is a % of the price:\n"
"        e.g 100 * (1 + 10%) = 110 (not price included)\n"
"        e.g 110 / (1 + 10%) = 100 (price included)\n"
"    - Percentage Tax Included: The tax amount is a division of the price:\n"
"        e.g 180 / (1 - 10%) = 200 (not price included)\n"
"        e.g 200 * (1 - 10%) = 180 (price included)\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    - ກຸ່ມອາກອນ: ອາກອນແມ່ນຊຸດຂອງອາກອນຍ່ອຍ.\n"
"    - ຄົງທີ່: ມູນຄ່າອາກອນຍັງຄືເກົ່າບໍ່ວ່າລາຄາຈະເປັນເທົ່າໃດ.\n"
"    - ເປີເຊັນ: ມູນຄ່າອາກອນແມ່ນ % ຂອງລາຄາ:\n"
"        ຕົວຢ່າງ: 100 * (1 + 10%) = 110 (ບໍ່ລວມໃນລາຄາ)\n"
"        ຕົວຢ່າງ: 110 / (1 + 10%) = 100 (ລວມໃນລາຄາ)\n"
"    - ເປີເຊັນລວມອາກອນ: ມູນຄ່າອາກອນແມ່ນຜົນຫານຂອງລາຄາ:\n"
"        ຕົວຢ່າງ: 180 / (1 - 10%) = 200 (ບໍ່ລວມໃນລາຄາ)\n"
"        ຕົວຢ່າງ: 200 * (1 - 10%) = 180 (ລວມໃນລາຄາ)\n"
"        "

#. module: account_tax_python
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_tax_python
msgid ""
"\n"
"A tax defined as python code consists of two snippets of python code which "
"are executed in a local environment containing data such as the unit price, "
"product or partner.\n"
"\n"
"\"Applicable Code\" defines if the tax is to be applied.\n"
"\n"
"\"Python Code\" defines the amount of the tax.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ອາກອນທີ່ກຳນົດເປັນໂຄດ Python ປະກອບດ້ວຍສອງສ່ວນຂອງໂຄດ Python ເຊິ່ງຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ"
"ພາຍໃນ ທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນເຊັ່ນ: ລາຄາຕໍ່ໜ່ວຍ, ສິນຄ້າ ຫຼື ຄູ່ຮ່ວມຄ້າ.\n"
"\n"
"\"Applicable Code\" ກຳນົດວ່າຈະນຳໃຊ້ອາກອນຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"\n"
"\"Python Code\" ກຳນົດມູນຄ່າຂອງອາກອນ.\n"

#. module: account_tax_python
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_tax_python.field_account_tax__formula
msgid ""
"Compute the amount of the tax.\n"
"\n"
":param base: float, actual amount on which the tax is applied\n"
":param price_unit: float\n"
":param quantity: float\n"
":param product: A object representing the product\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄິດໄລ່ມູນຄ່າຂອງອາກອນ.\n"
"\n"
":param base: float, ມູນຄ່າຕົວຈິງທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ອາກອນ\n"
":param price_unit: float\n"
":param quantity: float\n"
":param product: ວັດຖຸທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງສິນຄ້າ\n"

